      en: ["Part of the UNESCO Pendjari Biosphere Reserve", "Elevation between 150 and 200 meters", "Shaped by seasonal Pendjari River flooding", "One of the last sanctuaries for West African lions", "Consists predominantly of grass savannas", "Directly borders Burkina Faso"],
